<h2>Where should the filter controls go?</h2>
<p class="subtitle">Account activity page. The content of the controls is still open; this is about placement and how much space they take.</p>

<div class="options">
  <div class="option" data-choice="a" onclick="toggleSelect(this)">
    <div class="letter">A</div>
    <div class="content">
      <h3>Filter bar above the table</h3>
      <p>Always visible between the intro and the table. Event type, date range, and search sit in one row and wrap on narrow screens. A result count sits under the bar.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="option" data-choice="b" onclick="toggleSelect(this)">
    <div class="letter">B</div>
    <div class="content">
      <h3>"Filter" button that opens a panel</h3>
      <p>One button above the table opens a popover with the controls. Active filters show as removable tags beside the button. Keeps the page compact but hides the controls behind a click.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="option" data-choice="c" onclick="toggleSelect(this)">
    <div class="letter">C</div>
    <div class="content">
      <h3>Quick-filter tags plus a search field</h3>
      <p>A row of one-click tags for common views ("All", "Failed sign-ins", "Sign-ins", "Account changes") with a search field on the right. Fastest for the failed sign-in hunt; less precise than full controls.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <p class="label">A: Filter bar</p>
  <div class="mockup">
    <div class="mockup-header">Preview: filter bar above the table</div>
    <div class="mockup-body">
      <h3 style="margin:0">Account activity</h3>
      <p style="margin:4px 0 12px">Every sign-in and account change from the last 90 days, newest first.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-end;padding:12px;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:6px">
        <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:13px">Event type<select class="mock-input"><option>All events</option></select></label>
        <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:13px">From<input class="mock-input" value="Jul 1, 2026" style="width:110px"></label>
        <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:13px">To<input class="mock-input" value="Sep 28, 2026" style="width:110px"></label>
        <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;font-size:13px">Search<input class="mock-input" value="" placeholder="" style="width:180px"></label>
        <button class="mock-button">Clear filters</button>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size:13px;margin:8px 0">Showing 48 of 48 events</p>
      <div class="placeholder">When | Event | Device | Location | IP | Details</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

